          "filename": "Approximate site of Midland Bank, Balsall Heath Branch 40-11-03 - geograph.org.uk - 1107246.jpg",
          "caption": "Approximate site of Midland Bank, Balsall Heath Branch 40-11-03 I worked for Midland Bank HSBC for 32 years and spent all but the last two in Birmingham Branches. I am photographing all the branches,or what's left of them, as they were when I joined Midland Bank in 1963. The branches all start with the sorting code 40-11.\nThis is the approximate site of the Balsall Heath branch which was at 126 Balsall Heath Road. Few landmarks remain to give a more exact location. The sorting code was 40-11-03.",
